<div class="pg-hero" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl area.heroImage %});{% imageSet area.heroImage %}">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/areas-we-cover/">Areas We Cover</a> / <em>{{ area.name }}</em></p>
    <h1>Elderly &amp; House Removals in <em>{{ area.name }}</em>: Packing, Downsizing &amp; Full-Service Moves</h1>
    <p class="lead">Moving support for {{ area.name }} and {{ area.county }}, with extra care for older people, from our Northampton base</p>
    <div class="pg-chips">
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0114 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg>{{ area.distance }} from our office</span>
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>DBS-checked staff</span>
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5v8l-9 5-9-5V8z"/><path d="M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v8"/></svg>Fully insured removals</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% set fac = [["County", area.county],["Council", area.council],["Postcodes", area.postcodes],["From our office", area.distance + " " + area.direction + ", via " + area.road],["Hospital", area.hospital],["Getting around", area.rail]] %}
<section class="sa-block" style="padding:48px 0 12px;background:#fff">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>Chayce Properties arranges downsizing help, careful packing, fully insured removals and settling-in support in {{ area.name }}, {{ area.county }}, designed for older people and open to anyone, with one dedicated coordinator. We are based in Northampton, and {{ area.name }} is {{ area.distance }} {{ area.direction }} of our office. Packages start from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","url":"{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}","inLanguage":"en-GB","dateModified":"{{ modified }}","author":{"@id":"{{ site.url }}/#organization"},"speakable":{"@type":"SpeakableSpecification","cssSelector":["h1",".sa-block .stage-practice p"]}}</script>

<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="rx-lead">
      <div class="rx-photo">{% image area.image, "Homes and interiors in and around " + area.name %}<div class="rx-tag">from our office<strong>{{ area.distance | replace("around ", "") }}</strong>{{ area.direction }}</div></div>
      <div class="rx-copy">
        <span class="gd-eyebrow" style="text-align:left">{{ area.name }} &middot; {{ area.county }}</span>
        <h2>Need downsizing help and elderly removals <em>in {{ area.name }}?</em></h2>
        <p class="rx-sub">{{ area.context }}</p>
        <dl class="gd-facts">
          {% for row in fac %}<div><dt>{{ row[0] }}</dt><dd>{{ row[1] }}</dd></div>
          {% endfor %}
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rx-band" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl area.heroImage %});{% imageSet area.heroImage %}">
  <div class="container"><span class="gd-eyebrow">One coordinator</span><h2>Your move in {{ area.name }}, <em font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-light)>looked after from start to finish.</em></h2><p>We help older people and their families with downsizing, packing, removals and settling in when leaving a long-held home, whether that is a move within {{ area.name }} or to another part of the UK. One dedicated coordinator looks after the whole journey, so you are not juggling several separate companies.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Planning your move</span><h2>How do you plan elderly removals <em>in {{ area.name }}?</em></h2></div>
    <ol class="rx-tips lh-plan">
      {% for item in area.planFor %}<li><span class="rx-tn">0{{ loop.index }}</span><p>{{ item }}</p></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p class="rx-cap lh-plan-note">A move in {{ area.name }} falls under {{ area.council }}. You can find your local council, and its adult social care services, on <a href="https://www.gov.uk/find-local-council" rel="noopener">GOV.UK</a>.</p>
    {% if not area.localFaqs %}
    <p class="rx-cap" style="text-align:center;max-width:820px;margin-top:10px">Where to start: <a href="/downsizing-help-for-elderly/">downsizing help for older people</a>, <a href="/storage-during-your-move/">storage between house moves</a>, <a href="/moving-elderly-parent/">moving an elderly parent</a>, <a href="/care-home-removals/">care home removals</a>, <a href="/house-clearance-for-the-elderly/">help clearing a family home</a>, <a href="/elderly-move-manager-uk/">what an elderly move manager does</a> and our <a href="/services/">services</a>. See also <a href="/elderly-removals-northampton/">elderly removals in Northampton</a> and <a href="/areas-we-cover/">all the areas we cover</a>.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{% if area.moves %}
<section class="lh-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Client story &middot; {{ area.name }}</span><h2>A real move <em>in {{ area.name }}</em></h2></div>
