  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="pkg-faq-band lh-faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Questions</span><h2>Elderly removals <em>in {{ area.name }}</em></h2></div>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      {% if area.localFaqs %}
      {% for f in area.localFaqs %}<details><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><p>{{ f.a }}{% if f.url %} <a href="{{ f.url }}"{% if f.ext %} rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ f.linkText }}</a>.{% endif %}</p></details>
      {% endfor %}
      <details><summary>How much do removals in {{ area.name }} cost?</summary><p>Packages start at &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }} for packing and removals, with full-service moves from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}. A Discovery Consultation costs &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }} and gives you a personalised plan, timeline and budget before you commit to anything.</p></details>
      {% else %}
      <details><summary>{{ area.faqTitle }}</summary><p>{{ area.faqAnswer }}</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer downsizing help for older people in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>Yes. We help older people in {{ area.name }} decide what to keep, sell or pass on, pack with care, arrange the removal and settle in at the new home.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much do removals in {{ area.name }} cost?</summary><p>Packages start at &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }} for packing and removals, with full-service moves from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}. A Discovery Consultation costs &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }} and gives you a personalised plan, timeline and budget before you commit to anything.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What does an elderly move manager do in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>An elderly move manager plans and coordinates a later-life move from start to finish. In {{ area.name }}, Chayce provides this with one dedicated coordinator for sorting, packing, the removal and settling in. See <a href="/elderly-move-manager-uk/">what an elderly move manager does</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer house removals in {{ area.name }} for people of any age?</summary><p>Yes. Our service is designed with older people in mind, but anyone who wants a fully managed move is welcome. We provide one coordinator for packing, a fully insured removal and settling in, and you choose how much of the move we take on.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer removals for elderly people in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>Yes. Removals for older people are part of our service in {{ area.name }}. Every removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit, and a dedicated coordinator looks after the whole move.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer residential removals in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>Yes. Chayce arranges residential removals in {{ area.name }} and across the UK: packing, a fully insured removal and settling in, with one dedicated coordinator. Packages start at &pound;995, and you can start with a Discovery Consultation.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Are your staff DBS-checked?</summary><p>Yes. See our <a href="/trust-and-safeguarding/">trust and safeguarding page</a> for how we protect clients.</p></details>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Our packages</span><h2>Choose the <em>level of help</em> you need</h2></div>
    <ul class="rx-prices"><li><div class="rx-pn">&pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }}</div><h3>Discovery Consultation</h3><p>An hour with us, in person in Northampton or by phone, to plan your move, timeline and budget.</p><a href="/discovery/">See Discovery Consultation &rarr;</a></li><li><div class="rx-pn"><small>from</small>&pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}</div><h3>Bronze Essentials</h3><p>Packing, removals and light cleaning for a straightforward move.</p><a href="/bronze-essentials/">See Bronze Essentials &rarr;</a></li><li><div class="rx-pn"><small>from</small>&pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}</div><h3>Silver Comfort</h3><p>A full-service move with a dedicated coordinator, from sorting to unpacking.</p><a href="/silver-comfort/">See Silver Comfort &rarr;</a></li></ul>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin:44px 0 0"><a class="lh-more" href="/packages/">Compare all packages &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="lh-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Areas we cover</span><h2>Other towns <em>we help in</em></h2></div>
